[ Your Computer ]
       │
   (git push) ──> Saves new code to GitHub
       │
 [ GitHub PR Opened ] ──> Triggers the automation
       │
       ▼
 ┌───────────────┐
 │  CODERABBIT   │ ──(1. Extracts code diff)
 │ (The Manager) │ ──(2. Packages it into a clear prompt)
 └───────┬───────┘
         │
         │ (3. Sends API Request with Fine-Grained Token)
         ▼
 ┌───────────────┐
 │    GEMINI     │ ──(4. Reads & analyzes the code)
 │  (The Brain)  │ ──(5. Finds bugs, security flaws, typos)
 └───────┬───────┘
         │
         │ (6. Sends back review data: "Fix line 12, looks good!")
         ▼
 ┌───────────────┐
 │  CODERABBIT   │ ──(7. Generates human-friendly markdown comments)
 └───────┬───────┘
         │
         │ (8. Posts comments directly onto your GitHub Pull Request)
         ▼
 [ Pull Request Page ]
         │
   (If Approved) ──> GitHub Actions automatically merges it into 'main'
